Messwert.Meldungstext:
\T\L\S\K\APossible display:\L\S\K\N

x x x 0 0 0 0 0:
 0 = Normal enable
 1 = Transponder busy,
 2 = Incorrect current condition;
 3 = Incorrect ESCL authentication;
 4 = Incorrect key;
 5 = End-of-line enable;
 6 = General fault;
 7 = No Kessy enable, since basis active;
 8 = Enable due to terminal 15 login
 0 0 0 0 x 0 0 0: Enable terminal 15 (basis);
 0 0 0 0 0 x 0 0: Enable terminal 50 (basis);
 0 0 0 0 0 x 0 0: Kessy enable to terminal 50;
 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 x: -
